@XpressPay_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### =========================================================
### PART 1: AUTHENTICATION & AUTHORIZATION ENDPOINTS
### =========================================================

### 1. Login as Default Seeded Admin
POST {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrUserName": "admin@xpresspay.com",
  "password": "Admin@123456"
}

### 2. Register a New Regular User (default role: User)
POST {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sarah@xpresspay.com",
  "userName": "sarah",
  "password": "User@123456",
  "fullName": "Sarah Connor"
}

### 3. Login as New User
POST {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrUserName": "sarah@xpresspay.com",
  "password": "User@123456"
}

### 4. Access Protected Profile (Requires Any Valid Token)
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/protected/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Access User-Role Protected Resource (Requires Role: User)
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/protected/user-resource
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Access Admin Dashboard (Requires Role: Admin)
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### =========================================================
### PART 2: OPTIMIZED DATABASE QUERY ENDPOINTS (3,000+ DATASET)
### =========================================================

### 0. Retrieve Test Metadata (Pre-seeded Customers & Reference IDs)
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/optimized-queries/test-metadata

### 1. Scenario 1: Selective Projection & AsNoTracking
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/optimized-queries/customer-summary/c1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 2. Scenario 2: Split Query (AsSplitQuery)
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/optimized-queries/customer-details-split/c1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 3. Scenario 3: High-Performance Keyset (Seek) Pagination
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/optimized-queries/transactions-keyset?pageSize=15

### 4. Scenario 4: Server-Side Grouping & Aggregations
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/optimized-queries/daily-aggregates

### 5. Scenario 5a: SARGable Existence Check (AnyAsync -> SQL EXISTS)
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/optimized-queries/check-active/c1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 6. Scenario 5b: SARGable Range Query
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/optimized-queries/by-date-range

### 7. Scenario 6: Direct Bulk Updates (ExecuteUpdateAsync)
POST {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/optimized-queries/expire-stale?hoursAgo=24

### 8. Scenario 7: Pre-compiled Query (EF.CompileAsyncQuery)
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/optimized-queries/by-reference/TXN-REF-100001


### =========================================================
### PART 3: RATE LIMITING DEMONSTRATION ENDPOINTS
### =========================================================

### 1. Inspect Rate Limiting Status & Policy Configurations
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/rate-limiting/status

### 2. IP-Limited Endpoint (Limit: 5 requests per 10s per IP)
# Rapidly fire 6 requests to see 200 OK x 5, then HTTP 429 Too Many Requests
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/rate-limiting/ip-limited

### 3. API Key Limited Endpoint - Anonymous / Untrusted Tier (3 req / 10s)
# No X-Api-Key header supplied -> falls back to 3 requests per 10s per IP
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/rate-limiting/api-key-limited

### 4. API Key Limited Endpoint - Standard Tier (8 req / 10s)
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/rate-limiting/api-key-limited
X-Api-Key: xpresspay-standard-live-key

### 5. API Key Limited Endpoint - Premium Tier (15 req / 10s)
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/rate-limiting/api-key-limited
X-Api-Key: xpresspay-premium-live-key

### 6. Sliding Window Endpoint (6 req / 10s over 3 segments)
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/rate-limiting/sliding-limited

### 7. Unlimited Endpoint (Bypassed via [DisableRateLimiting])
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/rate-limiting/unlimited


### =========================================================
### PART 4: BACKGROUND JOB PROCESSING WITH HANGFIRE
### =========================================================

### 1. Synchronously Preview Aggregated Settlement Statement (No Job Enqueued)
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/reports/preview

### 2. Enqueue On-Demand Financial Settlement Report Job (Fire-and-Forget)
# Returns HTTP 202 Accepted immediately (< 15ms); runs in background
POST {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/reports/generate-job
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientEmail": "admin@xpresspay.com",
  "simulateFailure": false
}

### 3. Enqueue Job with Simulated Transient Failure (Demonstrates Automatic Retries)
# Fails with simulated SMTP timeout on attempt 1, Hangfire automatically retries with backoff!
# Inspect live at http://localhost:5000/hangfire under 'Retries'
POST {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/reports/generate-job
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientEmail": "finance-audit@xpresspay.com",
  "simulateFailure": true
}

### 4. Schedule Delayed Report Job (Runs after 10-second countdown)
# Hangfire places job in 'Scheduled' state; view countdown at http://localhost:5000/hangfire
POST {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/reports/schedule-job
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientEmail": "director@xpresspay.com",
  "delaySeconds": 10,
  "simulateFailure": false
}

### 5. Inspect Recurring Daily Job Status & Cron Schedule
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/reports/recurring-status

### 6. Manually Trigger Immediate Execution of the Recurring Job
POST {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/reports/trigger-recurring


### =========================================================
### PART 5: MICROSERVICES COMMUNICATION (REST IN NAIRA - NGN)
### =========================================================
@WalletService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5050

### 1. Inspect Demo Accounts directly in Wallet Service (:5050)
GET {{WalletService_HostAddress}}/api/wallets/demo-accounts

### 2. Inspect Demo Accounts via Payment Service Checkout Gateway (:5000)
GET {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/checkouts/test-accounts

### 3. Successful Checkout: Alice (₦500,000 NGN balance debited ₦50,000 NGN)
POST {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/checkouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerAccountId": "a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "amount": 50000.00,
  "currency": "NGN",
  "itemDescription": "Noise-Cancelling Headphones"
}

### 4. Insufficient Funds (Error 422): Bob (₦15,000 NGN balance attempting ₦50,000 NGN checkout)
POST {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/checkouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerAccountId": "b2000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "amount": 50000.00,
  "currency": "NGN",
  "itemDescription": "4K Smart TV"
}

### 5. Data Validation Error (Error 400): Negative Amount
POST {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/checkouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerAccountId": "a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "amount": -5000.00,
  "currency": "NGN",
  "itemDescription": "Invalid Negative Amount Purchase"
}

### 6. Data Validation Error (Error 400): Non-NGN Currency
POST {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/checkouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerAccountId": "a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "itemDescription": "Purchase in USD (only NGN accepted)"
}

### 7. Account Not Found (Error 404): Random Non-Existent Account
POST {{XpressPay_HostAddress}}/api/checkouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerAccountId": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999",
  "amount": 10000.00,
  "currency": "NGN",
  "itemDescription": "Ghost Account Purchase"
}

### 8. Authentication Check: Direct Wallet Service call without Service Key (Error 401)
POST {{WalletService_HostAddress}}/api/wallets/debit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "amount": 5000.00,
  "currency": "NGN",
  "referenceNumber": "UNAUTH-TEST-001"
}
